  "tip": "<p>Map the requirement for low latency <i>reads and writes</i> across distant user bases to services that provide <i>synchronous multi region replication</i> with strong consistency. Verify whether a managed database supports global placement of replicas rather than trying to add an external load balancer or custom data pipelines.</p>",
